Hi Rapache users.
I am reposting this problem that I came across two days ago and I am
not able to figure out where exactly the problem is.

The example  code below creates 3 buttons. First time when the page
loads, all three buttons work as desired.  Once any of the three
buttons is pressed, a new page opens up in another window and after
that none of the buttons works.

If I follow some other link and come back to the original page all the
buttons start working again.

I am confused what is going on here. I wrote exactly the same code in

php, and  works as desired.

I am attaching my R code below:

------------
filenames =  c("file1.txt", "file2.txt", "file3.txt")
namesToshow = c("file1", "file2", "file3")
numfiles = length(filenames)
for (i in 1: numfiles)
                {
                fn1 = filenames[i]
                cat('<form enctype=multipart/form-data method=GET
action="processFile.php" target="_blank" >')
                cat(paste('<input type="hidden" name="filetoview"
value=', fn1, '>',
sep=''))
                cat(paste('<input type="submit" style="height: 25px;
width: 200px"
value="', namesToshow[i],'">'))
                }

----------------------

Thanks for your time
Fahim

